>ن ت</span>َزَكَّىٰ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٨</span>"},{"id":19,"tajweed":"وَأَهْدِيَكَ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ فَتَخْشَىٰ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٩</span>"},{"id":20,"tajweed":"فَأَرَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ىٰ</span>هُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَيَةَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكُ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>رَىٰ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٠</span>"},{"id":21,"tajweed":"فَكَذَّبَ وَعَصَىٰ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢١</span>"},{"id":22,"tajweed":"ثُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َ أَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span>بَرَ يَسْعَىٰ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٢</span>"},{"id":23,"tajweed":"فَحَشَرَ فَنَادَىٰ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٣</span>"},{"id":24,"tajweed":"فَقَالَ أَنَا۟ رَبُّكُمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَعْلَىٰ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٤</span>"},{"id":25,"tajweed":"فَأَخَذَهُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ نَكَالَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَخِرَةِ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأُولَىٰٓ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٥</span>"},{"id":26,"tajweed":"إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ فِى ذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>لِكَ لَعِ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>رَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ةً ل</span>ِّم<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>َخْشَىٰٓ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٦</span>"},{"id":27,"tajweed":"ءَأَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span>ُمْ أَشَدُّ خَلْقًا أَمِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءُ‌ۚ بَنَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هَا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٧</span>"},{"id":28,"tajweed":"رَفَعَ سَمْكَهَا فَسَوَّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ىٰ</span>هَا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٨</span>"},{"id":29,"tajweed":"وَأَغْطَشَ لَيْلَهَا وَأَخْرَجَ ضُحَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ<